                            <div id="bodyContent_pageContent_PageTitlePanel">
<h2><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span id="bodyContent_pageContent_PageTitleLabel">Directions</span></span></h2>
</div>
<div id="bodyContent_pageContent_CurrentContentAreaPanel">
<p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/%22Florence-Darlington+Technical+College/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here for interactive directions from Google.</a></p>
<p><strong>From the West</strong><br>

Take I-20 East toward Florence.<br>

Merge left onto I-95 N. via Exit 141A toward Fayetteville.<br>

Travel 2 miles, then turn right onto US-52 N via Exit 164 toward Darlington.<br>

Travel 1.6 miles to Florence-Darlington Technical College (FDTC).<br>

<br>

<strong>From the South</strong><br>

Take I-95 North toward Florence.<br>

Turn right onto US-52 N via Exit 164 toward Darlington.<br>

Travel 1.6 miles to Florence-Darlington Technical College (FDTC).<br>

<br>

<strong>From the North via I-95</strong><br>

Take I-95 South toward Florence.<br>

Turn right onto US-52 N via Exit 164 toward Darlington.<br>

Travel 1.6 miles to Florence-Darlington Technical College (FDTC).<br>

<br>

<strong>From the East</strong><br>

Take US-76/301 West toward Florence.<br>

Turn right onto Highway 327 N toward I-95<br>

Travel 10 miles to I-95 and turn right onto I-95 South toward Savannah<br>

Travel 5 miles to Exit 164<br>

Turn right onto US-52 N via Exit 164 toward Darlington.<br>

Travel 1.6 miles to Florence-Darlington Technical College (FDTC).<br>

<br>

<strong>From the Florence Regional Airport</strong><br>

Turn left out of the Florence Regional Airport on to 76/301 towards Florence<br>

Travel 1 mile and bare to the right on to Cheves Street towards Church Street<br>

Travel 1 mile (you will see the McLeod Medical Center complex on your right) and turn right on to Church Street towards Hwy 52<br>

Note - Church Street turns in to Lucas St/Hwy 52<br>

Travel 3.3 miles and go under Interstate 95<br>

Travel 1.6 miles to Florence-Darlington Technical College (FDTC).<br>

<br>

<strong>By Air</strong><br>

Florence Regional Airport (<a href="http://www.florencescairport.com">http://www.florencescairport.com</a>); Major carriers include US Airways.<br>

Other Airports:<br>

Columbia, South Carolina (81 miles)<br>

Charlotte, North Carolina (157 miles)<br>

Atlanta, Georgia (290 miles)<br>

<br>

<strong>By Ground</strong><br>

Local taxis are available<br>

Rental cars may be obtained from Avis, Budget, Hertz, and Enterprise<br>

Some hotels provide airport shuttles (fee charged)</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img src="/information/visiting/5000_bldg.jpg?max_height=267&amp;max_width=400" width="400" height="267">
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/information/visiting/SiMT.jpg?max_height=267&amp;max_width=355" width="355" height="267">
</p>
